<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank end-Oct forex reserves ease slightly.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank end-Oct forex reserves ease slightly.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank said on Tuesday that its foreign exchange reserves at the end of October stood at $12.668 billion, compared with $12.691 billion at the end of September.</p>
</text>
